(1,'MQQDLV','Arijit Pramanik',7604068136,'aaarijit3@gmail.com',101,35,3683,'Uluberia','22.4763526,88.08979339999999','1994-06-16 14:20:00','M','5','Religious\nLove to meditate\nNon-vegetarian \nLove to read story books\nLike to work-out (gym, yoga)\nNon Drinker, Non Smoker\nLiving with mother \nI like doing research about different things and gain knowledge \nLooking for a peaceful yet adventurous life ','Hin-Beng','M',13,'N','N','N','N',0,NULL,NULL,'1-1994-06-16T08-50-00.000Z.json',5,11,14,NULL,'N',NULL,'Y','Y','N','N','Arijit Pramanik','2023-11-11 12:33:34','admin','2023-11-16 12:26:08'),
(2,'MSLE5H','Prasun Das Gupta',6295079939,'prasundg2019@gmail.com',101,41,5333,'Asansol','23.6888636,86.9660638','1994-06-26 14:15:00','M','5','I am self-employed( Science plus Computer Teacher up to graduation degree) with possessing a B.Tech (Computer Science) currently living in Asansol with a moderate value emolument. I always look forward positive attitude in every actives.','Hin-Beng','M',3,'N','N','Y','N',0,NULL,NULL,'2-1994-06-26T08-45-00.000Z.json',10,22,30,'IMG-20230607-WA0001.jpg','Y','A','Y','Y','N','N','Prasun Das Gupta','2023-11-11 12:33:44','Prasun Das Gupta','2023-12-29 09:47:55'),
(3,'MY1ZYY','Bhaskar Maitra',9051740220,'bmaitra00@gmail.com',101,41,5312,'Kolkata','22.572646,88.36389500000001','1979-10-14 08:39:00','M','5','Only child. Father expired in 2008. He used to work in Indian Oil in the Manager grade. Mother is a housewife.Own a single storey house near Dum Dum Airport. No vehicles. Traditional  Ghoti Brahmin Housewife preferable; However others can also apply.','Hin-Beng','M',8,'N','N','Y','N',0,NULL,NULL,'3-1979-10-14T03-09-00.000Z.json',4,8,11,'Bhaskar Maitra Photo 1.jpeg','N',NULL,'N','N','N','N','Bhaskar Maitra','2023-11-11 12:33:57','Bhaskar Maitra','2023-12-16 09:31:59'),
(4,'MSTOQA','Sandip Chakraborty',9647292227,'sandipchakra01@gmail.com',101,41,5723,'Ramrajatala','22.5925306,88.2953339','1991-07-27 08:10:00','M','5','I\'m very moderate and responsible in nature. Honesty with a simple life is my target. I\'m non smoker, non alcoholic. Listening to music mainly old cinematic song , gardening , bike riding is my hobby. ','Hin-Beng','M',11,'N','N','N','N',0,NULL,NULL,'4-1991-07-27T02-40-00.000Z.json',10,22,30,'ok (2).jpg','Y','P','Y','Y','N','N','Sandip Chakraborty','2023-11-11 12:34:04','Sandip Chakraborty','2023-12-25 12:51:55'),
